CLOSING: this change is MERGED to main. Gerrit 1090 was submitted together with its 9 ancestors (1012-1090) and shows status MERGED; the merge was gated on Verified +1 and LLM-Review +1.

PRE-SUBMIT REGRESSION CHECK (the operator's landing authorization is conditional on no regression, and explicitly notes that passing CI is NOT sufficient):
- the 10 commits rebased onto current main CLEANLY, 0 conflicts;
- full suite on main+1-10: 8372 passed, 0 FAILED, 12 errors — and a CONTROL run of the same three test files on PLAIN origin/main reproduced all 12 identically (39 passed / 12 errors, same ids). They are a probe artifact (an un-provisioned worktree via PYTHONPATH, so the packaging tests build a wheel and trip the REPO_ROOT leak guard), NOT a regression. Delta attributable to these commits: zero;
- LLM behaviour on this project's own dogfooded config: WIRE-IDENTICAL. The verifier string anthropic:claude-sonnet-4-6 keeps temperature and identical prompt-cache keys. The single delta, anthropic:claude-opus-4-8 losing temperature, is a no-op on the wire because pydantic-ai's Anthropic adapter already drops it at models/anthropic.py:641 — which is exactly the production observation THIS bug's own capability-override table records. Greedy Pass-2 runs on sonnet and is preserved; cfg.temperature is None here in any case.
